WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.400
A ruler, held down on a table. Slowed right down.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.200
Let go: the free end swings back and forth. It vibrates.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.000
The pen draws each swing as it happens.

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.000
Push the end down further before you let go.

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A bigger swing makes a louder sound.

6
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
It swings just as fast as before, so the note stays the same.

7
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.400
Slide the ruler in, so less of it hangs over the edge.

8
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.800
A shorter free end vibrates faster.

9
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.000
Faster vibration makes a higher note.

10
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.400
Bang a metal tray near a drum with rice on it.

11
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.000
The air passes the vibration along, bunching and spreading.

12
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Air makes the drum skin vibrate, so the rice jumps.

13
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.000
Something vibrates. The vibration is passed on. That is sound.

